I agree completely with you that bows/crossbows are very underated
in nethack...  They don't seem to do as much damage as they would
have in "real life."  They *should* be a deadly weapon. It seems
in nethack that they just don't do that much damage.  (Sorry, I 
haven't checked, this is all on the *it seems to be* approach.)

But I have a question about your 2 problems listed.  It appears
that you are implying in number one that in "real life" there
was/is an unlimitted ammo supply, or at least a greater supply
than in nethack.  I don't think this is at all true, is it?
How many people in the 13,14,etc... (or before) hundreds carried
around 1000 arrows for their bow?  Ya get the point.... If you're
going to try and make the weapon more powerful, you certainly
don't want to make the ammo more plentiful.  That would make
things too easy... You would shoot things across the room
and kill them before they ever got to you....

Anyway, enough rambling for now.....


